---

<LpBase
  title="Consultoria PBQP-H com a Templum: Certificação garantida"
  description="Consultoria PBQP-H com a Templum, Qualidade na Construção: implante e certifique com método próprio, 100% online e garantia de 200% (certifique ou devolvemos o dobro)."
  schemas={[faqSchema]}
  hideChrome={true}
  lcpImage="/assets/lp/pbqph-v2/hero.avif"
  headerCta={cta}
  h1Experimento={h1}
>
  <link slot="head" rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link slot="head" rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" />
  <div class="v2">
    <header class="v2-bar">
      <div class="v2-bar-in">
        <a class="v2-logo" href="/consultoria/pbqp-h-lp-v2/" aria-label="Templum">
          <img src="/assets/lp/pbqph-v2/logo-templum.svg" alt="Templum" width="120" height="32" />
        </a>
        <nav class="v2-nav" aria-label="Seções">
          <a href="#sobre">Sobre a Certificação</a>
          <a href="#como-funciona">Como Funciona</a>
          <a href="#beneficios">Benefícios</a>
          <a href="#depoimentos">Depoimentos</a>
          <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
        </nav>
        <button type="button" class="v2-split v2-split--outline v2-split--sm" data-abre-form data-cta-pos="menu">
          <span class="v2-split__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 5L19 12L12 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
          <span class="v2-split__label">{cta}</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="v2-menu" aria-label="Abrir menu" aria-expanded="false" data-menu>
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12H21M3 6H21M3 18H21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="v2-menu-panel" data-menu-panel hidden>
      <button type="button" class="v2-menu-x" data-menu-close aria-label="Fechar menu">×</button>
      <nav>
        <a href="#sobre">Sobre a Certificação</a>
        <a href="#como-funciona">Como Funciona</a>
        <a href="#beneficios">Benefícios</a>
        <a href="#depoimentos">Depoimentos</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      </nav>
      <button type="button" class="v2-split v2-split--primary v2-split--lg" data-abre-form data-cta-pos="menu" data-menu-close>
        <span class="v2-split__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 5L19 12L12 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
        <span class="v2-split__label">{cta}</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <section class="v2-hero">
      <div class="v2-wrap v2-hero-grid">
        <div class="v2-hero-copy">
          <p class="v2-pill">A consultoria digital nº 1 do Brasil</p>
          <h1 id="tpl-h1">Certifique sua construtora no <span>PBQP-H ou receba 200%</span> do valor investido de volta</h1>
          <script is:inline>
            if (window.tplH1Aplicar) window.tplH1Aplicar();
          </script>
          <ul class="v2-checks">
            <li><span class="v2-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="9" viewBox="0 0 12 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4L4.5 7.5L11 1" stroke="#200801" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span>{preco} com o Templum OS, nosso software com IA que padroniza processos, indica não conformidades e muito mais.</span></li>
            <li><span class="v2-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="9" viewBox="0 0 12 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4L4.5 7.5L11 1" stroke="#200801" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span>Acesse financiamentos da Caixa Econômica Federal.</span></li>
